{"reviewId": "426066534_88uOgIShG", "review": {"abstract": "从历史的康波价格运行来看，萧条期的开始必然是一个价格反弹的过程，所以，一个非常重要的问题就是，我们这次康波衰退向萧条的转换点在哪里，这也是对商品价格最终低点的确认过程", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这里有点问题，假如决策者吸取以前经验教训，提前介入出台宽松政策呢？绝对低点在当时很难判断吧，只能是回顾历史，诶，发现某段时间是低点", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "30405-30488", "createTime": 1776643823, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "426066534_88uOgIShG", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1778337653, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 337350535, "name": "清风竹影·静", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM7dWbbCA8jczaM0ZxE3SvXLpichIt8JsmlxkgGshNsKF0A/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "实际上到了衰退转萧条期，宽松政策刺激作用已经边际效用达峰，更多的流动性要么继续给过剩产能